也還算寬敞。\n可惜店內消費只收現金，不能刷卡也沒有行動支付。",null,[0,56]]]],[],[null,null,46482,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SYU1GQk5hbTF0T0hCbGJIWjZVRWRqVVd4cWIxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x98aed6ab02f6c2cc!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnRaMFBNam1tOHBlbHZ6UEdjUWxqb1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SYU1GQk5hbTF0T0hCbGJIWjZVRWRqVVd4cWIxRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SYU1GQk5hbTF0T0hCbGJIWjZVRWRqVVd4cWIxRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SYU1GQk5hbTF0T0hCbGJIWjZVRWRqVVd4cWIxRRILMGRWaHU0bGNuWGUaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uUmFNRkJOYW0xdE9IQmxiSFo2VUVkalVXeHFiMUUSCzBkVmh1NGxjblhlIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARzML2AqvWrpgqCzBkVmh1NGxjblhl\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiKs5CN8dSWAxW3oK8BHYdZH4EQoykITigL"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjozZeN8dSWAxW6eF4EHY_aFPAQ0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKs5CN8dSWAxW3oK8BHYdZH4EQ0pMFCDsoAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214dFRETXRZbTU0UkdablZteERTVUYyTTNSTE5IYxAB",["0x0:0x98aed6ab02f6c2cc",null,1774188972378542,1774191087000446,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102957934055381267258/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["湘湘","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW6_7n3tpkh6TVleTQWavBbZ2mpTkPanZtU3BhAloibtUM7rNc-\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102957934055381267258?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"102957934055381267258",null,422,2227,null,[1,8,1],5,["在地嚮導 · 422 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwiKs5CN8dSWAxW3oK8BHYdZH4EQpr8GCFAoAA"]]]],null,"5 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[4],null,[["CIABIhD-lpneANV1bULs66qsac3R",["CIABIhD-lpneANV1bULs66qsac3R",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNdShaTyqgJpK_t2s_gQaTqLOt1DzZfLZOB4rCQQnJ57AUCf_9A2B7PUi2WGns7OoGr_KRtR3wBcy-YmPpEXjfL-F1Fuvh5F8OkUT6L3FKSY3fplwQrds_oAS535kzxiLkX