AxW3oK8BHYdZH4EQ3YcHCGkoAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiKs5CN8dSWAxW3oK8BHYdZH4EQ3IcHCGgoDg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKs5CN8dSWAxW3oK8BHYdZH4EQ3YcHCGsoAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiKs5CN8dSWAxW3oK8BHYdZH4EQ3IcHCGooDw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["一踏入店內，濃郁的蝦香味便撲鼻而來。不過店內的規定較為嚴格，要求人數到齊後方可入座，這點對客人來說稍嫌不便；桌上也貼有減少使用手機與交談的告示，略顯嚴格。\n\n這次點了濃出汁蝦拉麵、濃厚豚骨蝦沾麵與叉燒飯。\n\n濃出汁蝦拉麵：採用細麵，湯頭濃郁且充滿蝦香，喝得出師傅的用心，重點是味道剛好不過鹹。單點附有兩片叉燒，口感偏薄但表現出色；三角形的筍子造型可愛，吃起來清脆爽口。\n\n濃厚豚骨蝦沾麵：醬汁的蝦味比拉麵更上一層樓，第一口令人驚艷。雖然單點沒有整片肉，但醬汁內藏有幾塊紮實、具嚼勁的肉塊；麵條口感近似烏龍麵，非常有彈性。\n\n叉燒飯：送上桌時被精緻的份量忍不住笑了一下，餐點小巧可愛很像兒童餐。大約五片小叉燒肥瘦適中，入口即化，尤其搭配拉麵湯底或沾麵醬汁一起食用，美味程度大加分！\n-\n\n濃出汁蝦拉麵 $260\n\n濃厚豚骨蝦沾麵（中）$260\n\n叉燒飯 $70",null,[0,102]]]],[],[null,null,6337,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214dFRETXRZbTU0UkdablZteERTVUYyTTNSTE5IYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x98aed6ab02f6c2cc!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmxtTDMtYm54RGZnVmxDSUF2M3RLNHc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214dFRETXRZbTU0UkdablZteERTVUYyTTNSTE5IYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214dFRETXRZbTU0UkdablZteERTVUYyTTNSTE5IYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214dFRETXRZbTU0UkdablZteERTVUYyTTNSTE5IYxILMGRrLTZqLTBoLVEaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09teHRURE10WW01NFJHWm5WbXhEU1VGMk0zUkxOSGMSCzBkay02ai0waC1RIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARzML2AqvWrpgqCzBkay02ai0waC1R\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiKs5CN8dSWAxW3oK8BHYdZH4EQoykIbCgQ"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjozZeN8dSWAxW6eF4EHY_aFPAQ0pMFCBYoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKs5CN8dSWAxW3oK8BHYdZH4EQ0pMFCE8oAQ"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SNGRqbFZWelI0V0ROQlQzZExVMVpVVWxKalEwRRAB",["0x0:0x98aed6ab02f6c2cc",null,1784218015423878,1784218015423878,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112522168987221545310/reviews?hl\u003dzh-T